<title>UK: RTZ-CRA first half net falls to $522 mln.</title>
<headline>RTZ-CRA first half net falls to $522 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (U.S. cents)	 39.5		   vs 50.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 10.6		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Dividend (Aus. cents)  20.65		  vs n/a</p>
<p> Net adjusted earnings  522		    vs 711</p>
<p> Pretax		     891		    vs 1,253</p>
<p> Turnover		   4,003		  vs 4,239</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on net adjusted earnings, which exclude exceptional items, were in a range of $516 to $558 million.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 651		    vs 1.06</p>
<p> Share of associates    242		    vs 215</p>
<p> Exceptional		nil		    vs 235 charge</p>
<p> Interest charge	  2.0		    vs 27</p>
<p> Tax pre-exceptionals   270		    vs 445</p>
<p> Net taxed		  621		    vs 639</p>
<p> Attributable	     552		    vs 542</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
